-- src:1162 | “Accounting Standards” means the accounting standards made
-- src:1163 | or formulated by the Accounting Standards Committee under
-- src:1164 | Part 3 of the Accounting Standards Act 2007 and applicable
-- src:1169 | to companies and to foreign companies in respect of their
-- src:1170 | operations in Singapore for the purposes of this Act;
