       AND (NOT `the address is a post office box number`)
       AND `the address is located in the same jurisdiction as the individual's residential address`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“contact address”, in relation to an individual, means an address that meets all of the following conditions: (a) it is a physical address at which the individual can be physically found or contacted by post; (b) it is not a post office box number; (c) it is located in the same jurisdiction as the individual’s residential address;"


-- src:1320 | “contributory”, in relation to a company, means a person liable
-- src:1321 | to contribute to the assets of the company in the event of its
-- src:1322 | being wound up, and includes the holder of fully paid shares
-- src:1323 | in the company and, prior to the final determination of the
-- src:1324 | persons who are contributories, includes any person alleged
-- src:1325 | to be a contributory;
@ref s 4(1) "contributory" (src:1320-1325)
GIVEN `the person is liable to contribute to the assets of the company in the event of its being wound up` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the holder of fully paid shares in the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the persons who are contributories have not yet been finally determined and the person is alleged to be a contributory` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 4(1) "contributory" the person is within the word contributory` MEANS
    IF    `the person is liable to contribute to the assets of the company in the event of its being wound up`
       OR `the person is the holder of fully paid shares in the company`
       OR `the persons who are contributories have not yet been finally determined and the person is alleged to be a contributory`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "“contributory”, in relation to a company, means a person liable to contribute to the assets of the company in the event of its being wound up, and includes the holder of fully paid shares in the company and, prior to the final determination of the persons who are contributories, includes any person alleged to be a contributory;"


-- src:1327 | “corporation” means any body corporate formed or incorporated
-- src:1328 | or existing in Singapore or outside Singapore and includes
-- src:1329 | any foreign company but does not include —
-- src:1331 | (a) any body corporate that is incorporated in Singapore
-- src:1332 | and is by notification of the Minister in the Gazette
-- src:1333 | declared to be a public authority or an instrumentality
-- src:1334 | or agency of the Government or to be a body
-- src:1335 | corporate which is not incorporated for commercial
-- src:1336 | purposes;
-- src:1338 | (b) any corporation sole;
-- src:1340 | (c) any cooperative society;
-- src:1342 | (d) any registered trade union;
-- src:1346 | (da) any platform work association registered under the
-- src:1347 | Platform Workers Act 2024; or
-- src:1351 | (e) any limited liability partnership;
@ref s 4(1) "corporation" (src:1327-1351)
GIVEN body IS A `s 4(1) body`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 4(1) "corporation" the body is a corporation` MEANS
    IF    body's `it is incorporated in Singapore and declared by notification of the Minister in the Gazette to be a public authority, an instrumentality or agency of the Government, or a body corporate which is not incorporated for commercial purposes`
       OR body's `it is a corporation sole`
       OR body's `it is a cooperative society`
       OR body's `it is a registered trade union`
       OR body's `it is a platform work association registered under the Platform Workers Act 2024`
       OR body's `it is a limited liability partnership`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "but does not include (a) any body corporate that is incorporated in Singapore and is by notification of the Minister in the Gazette declared to be a public authority ...; (b) any corporation sole; (c) any cooperative society; (d) any registered trade union; (da) any platform work association registered under the Platform Workers Act 2024; or (e) any limited liability partnership" (a body that is a foreign company AND an excluded body, such as a cooperative society formed abroad, is excluded: fork line F-C1 in NOTES.md)
    ELSE (IF    body's `it is a body corporate formed or incorporated or existing in Singapore or outside Singapore`
             OR `s 4(1) "foreign company" the body is a foreign company` body EQUALS JUST TRUE
          THEN JUST TRUE
          ELSE JUST FALSE)   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "means any body corporate formed or incorporated or existing in Singapore or outside Singapore and includes any foreign company" (a "means" definition: a body that is neither is not a corporation)


