      `the payment is made or given, directly or indirectly, to the director or auditor` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the payment is made or given by the company, or by a holding company or a subsidiary of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the payment is made or given to the director or auditor in that capacity, or otherwise in connection with the affairs of the company or of the holding company or the subsidiary` IS A BOOLEAN
