-- src:1704 | “residential address” means —
-- src:1706 | (a) in the case of a person registered under the National
-- src:1707 | Registration Act 1965 — the place of residence of
-- src:1708 | that person as registered under that Act; or
-- src:1710 | (b) in the case of a person not registered under the
-- src:1711 | National Registration Act 1965 — the usual
-- src:1712 | residential address of that person;
