      `the place of residence of the person as registered under that Act` IS A STRING
      `the usual residential address of the person` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
`s 4(1) "residential address" the residential address of the person` MEANS
    IF `the person is registered under the National Registration Act 1965`
    THEN `the place of residence of the person as registered under that Act`
    ELSE `the usual residential address of the person`


